\f1\fs26 Alexander Shakti\'97police lieutenant and feted media celebrity\'97manufactured his famous smile for the enthralled audience. Despite falling ratings, disillusioned sponsors, and increasing pressure to fake evidence, the show must go on. Specifically, this the final episode recording for the day must go on. \
\'93Good evening my friends. Welcome to another episode of 
