\'93Number 4: shark tank. Number 5: one thousand cuts. Number 6 is acid injection. Number 7: packet of peanuts\'97the get-out-of-jail-free card, folks!\'94\
The audience booed.\
\'93But I\'92m anaphylactic,\'94 Hammersmith complained weakly.\
The audience cheered.\
\'93We know,\'94 Alexander said behind his hand to Hammersmith, loud enough so the mics would pick it up. \'93Number 8: snake pit. Number 9: drowning in a cesspool of fetid milk products.\'94\
